      "authorId": "UCrFw1m8micEzzPUn_ewM8bw",
      "text": "Forgive me if y'all have already answered this because I haven't had a chance to catch up on the last few live streams. \n\nI would love y'all's opinion on design engineers. I am a product designer who loves coding and creating things with Claude Code, so I have a few questions: \n1. How long do you think design engineers as a role will be around, or do you think that's the direction our industry is going?\n2. If I wanted to make the jump from product designer to design engineer, what kind of projec",
